11-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-24T11:19:44-07:00","id":1096419,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>yrtalien</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1095882-metamorphosis#post1095882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can metamorphosis change a snake into a gun?<br /> Can it change a boy into something rose?<br /> <br /> Is there a mechanical benefit to shrinking or growing...<br /> <br /> As far as things like turning into a Dragon, I assume stats are up to me? Don't suppose anyone knows a WoD book (any edition) that might cover some.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, coming up with stats on the fly is a bit of a headache from an ST perspective, especially when it comes to Legendary Creatures Of Yore. I'd probably give a player a number of chimera points to build legendary forms (without Redes) and ask them to do it between sessions. Then, each success would confer an appropriate Rede for free per the Cantrip. <br /> <br /> re: change of size, I'd confer some Merits or Flaws as appropriate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13420-gl1tterboots","name":"gl1tterboots","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom"